#   https://www.rnaconfviewer.com/download/RCV-0.6.0-Windows-x64-Setup.exe          (newest release)
/download/:file         https://github.com/PrinceWang2018/RNAconfViewer_website/releases/latest/download/:file  302
/download/:tag/:file    https://github.com/PrinceWang2018/RNAconfViewer_website/releases/download/:tag/:file    302

